  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Inspecting Web Pages\r\n\r\nIn this level, your goal is to use the **Tag Inspector** to explore the \"hidden code\" that determine how webpages look and feel. In the next few levels, you'll be able to explore these more deeply\r\n\r\nThe **HTML Element** describes the _structure_ of your webpage. Try to find at least 4 different kinds of HTML elements.\r\n\r\nThe **CSS Rules** describe the _style_ of your webpage. Compare the rules to what you see on the screen and try to guess at least 4 different CSS rules.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n- Move your mouse around the webpage and notice how the Tag Inspector on the right-side updates\r\n- (Optional) Share your guesses with AI Tutor to see if you guessed correctly!\r\n- Once you've found at least 4 different HTML elements and have a guess for at least 4 different CSS rules: continue to the next page.",
